message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "MOSE: Multipurpose Open Solver for ideal-gas Equations"
abstract: "An open-source compressible flow solver for the Euler and
  Navier-Stokes equations on multi-block structured grids, written in modern
  Fortran, with RANS turbulence closures, equilibrium and finite-rate chemistry, 
  and rotating reference frame capabilities.
type: software
